Figure S12. TEM images of the cellular uptake of SW1990 cells after incubation with PtFe@Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NRs for different times. 1) 0 h; 2) 6 h; 3) 12 h; 4) 24 h. SW1990 cells were seeded in 12-well plates with concentration of $8 \times 10^4$ and incubated for 24 h. PtFe@Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NRs (100 μg mL<sup>−1</sup>) were added incubated for 6, 12, and 24 h, respectively. Then the cells were collected and fixed in 4% formaldehyde for further observation by Bio-TEM.

