Figure S2. EDX measurement of PtFe@Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NRs.

Figure S3. Infrared thermal images of PBS and PtFe@Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NRs with concentration of 100 μg mL<sup>−1</sup> under 808 nm laser irradiation (1.0 W cm<sup>−2</sup>).

Figure S4. Temperature changes measurement of PtFe@Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NRs, PtFe NRs and Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NPs dispersion under 808 nm laser irradiation for 10 min. The final working concentrations of PtFe@Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NRs, PtFe NRs and Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NPs were 100 μg mL<sup>−1</sup>, 32 μg mL<sup>−1</sup>, 68 μg mL<sup>−1</sup>, respectively.

Figure S5. Temperature-dependent POD-like activity of PtFe@Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NRs. 50 μL PtFe@Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NRs (100 μg mL<sup>−1</sup>) was incubated with 50 μL TMB liquid substrate system at different temperatures for 30 min and the absorbance at 652 nm was measured (n=3). Mean values and error bars are defined as mean and s.d., respectively.

Figure S6. pH-dependent POD-like activity of PtFe@Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NRs. 50 μL PtFe@Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NRs (100 μg mL<sup>−1</sup>) coincubated with 50 μL TMB liquid substrate system at different pH buffers for 30 min and the absorbance at 652 nm (n=3) was measured. Mean values and error bars are defined as mean and s.d., respectively.

Figure S7. Kinetics for POD-like activities of a) PtFe@Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NRs to H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub> substrate; b) PtFe@Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NRs to TMB substrate; c) PtFe NRs to H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub> substrate; d) PtFe NRs to TMB substrate; e) Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NPs to H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub> substrate; f) Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> NPs to TMB substrate. Error bars represent the standard error derived from three independent measurements. Mean values and error bars are defined as mean and s.d., respectively.

