Fig. S6. ESR spectra for mechanism investigations: measurements of (A) oxygen production by buffer + H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub> + CTPO + Au@Pt<sub>3.15</sub> (a, 0 mM; b, 0.5 mM; c, 5mM); (B) hydroxyl radicals for (a) buffer + DMPO, (b) Au + DMPO, (c) Au@Pt<sub>3.15</sub> + DMPO, (d) Au + H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub> + DMPO, (e) Au@Pt<sub>3.15</sub> + H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub> + DMPO; (C) singlet oxygen for (a) buffer + TEMP, (b) Au + TEMP, (c) Au@Pt<sub>3.15</sub> + TEMP and (D) superoxide anions for (a) DMSO + DMPO, (b) Au + DMPO, (c) Au@Pt<sub>3.15</sub> + DMPO.

