<caption>Table I. Relationship between the size of GNPs and the ratio of reactants.</caption>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Volume of 1% HAuCl<sub>4</sub></th>
<th>Volume of 1% trisodium citrate</th>
<th>Size of GNPs</th>
</tr>
